        <mxCell id="iefagswG0spB1CcRxWZt-17" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;A ENTIDADE CONTEM:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;646&quot; data-start=&quot;531&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;543&quot; data-start=&quot;531&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1iu0jtu&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;atributos;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;562&quot; data-start=&quot;544&quot; data-section-id=&quot;17sf9xp&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;relacionamentos;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;581&quot; data-start=&quot;563&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1jtge94&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;getters/setters;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;601&quot; data-start=&quot;582&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1oqrnzm&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;anotações do JPA;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;646&quot; data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1fk93gm&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;regras de validação através das anotações.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;⚠️ Correção importante: a entidade &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 40px;&quot; data-end=&quot;733&quot; data-start=&quot;685&quot;&gt;não é responsável por executar as validações&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;. Ela declara as regras, por exemplo &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 40px;&quot; data-end=&quot;781&quot; data-start=&quot;770&quot;&gt;@NotBlank&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt; e &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 40px;&quot; data-end=&quot;790&quot; data-start=&quot;784&quot;&gt;@Min&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;. Quem executa essas validações é o mecanismo de Bean Validation/Spring Validation quando solicitado.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
